{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Boots & Shoes|$Ranger's Boots}}

A pair of boots that form part of the [[:Category:Ranger's Set|Ranger's set]] of clothing. 


Quality formula: <math> (avgQLeather) + (avgQHardenedLeather) + (avgQSilkThread) \over 3 </math> and is [[Softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt{sewing*dex}</math>.

==Gilding==

Gilding is based on agility and stealth, with a 20% to 45% chance.

